Description:
  Fills every prompt photon with |eta| < 0.25. Isolation uses R=0.5 and
  requires the accepted cone energy other than the photon to be below 10% of
  its energy, with a 0.2 GeV/c charged-momentum and 0.3 GeV neutral-energy threshold. Both
  inclusive and isolated invariant cross sections and isolated-photon
  helicity yields are provided for normalized four-helicity combination.
  Add independently normalized hard-process samples per helicity before
  forming ALL. The WithLoop campaign includes the finite gg -> gamma g loop
  in addition to the unmerged tree photon+jet and QCD-dijet shower samples.
  Full-cone particle-level isolation is used, not a detector simulation.
